  "description": "Pyo Min is your average hetero dude in college: he likes his meat, never really has any money, and he really likes girls. Until he meets Jisoo, that is. After a night of too many drinks, he realizes that not only does he have it in him to sleep with the same sex, he...really likes it. But the deeper and deeper he finds his emotions for Jisoo become...the further Jisoo pulls away... What secret is Jisoo hiding?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
